  "description": "Andra Aveline and Dustin Ayrac were born sworn enemies just because their families are at odds. Andra has a passion for the pursuit of knowledge, while Dustin is the epitome of physical prowess. As they both try to complete their academy graduation assignments, they fall into a dungeon. There, in the darkness, an ancient spell that brings out their carnal urges takes hold of them. Now, they have to find a way to break this spell, but can they hold back their desires long enough to do that?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
